{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57046f0775e67fa0d7e608fa96996c2edf97563.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\usepackage{gensymb} A = 20 \\degree$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cba6e44c7dc69d5f9448eb7c8a0d315b3d1b673.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\usepackage{gensymb} B = 25 \\degree$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d8034114ea7ffb5b5a14266c70f0913a4aabda8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1+\\tan A\\right)\\left(1+\\tan B\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/4898f3e3196d8f3bded814a324d60dbfe988327d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } \\sqrt{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 1+\\sqrt{2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 2\\left(\\tan A+\\tan B\\right) \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"622\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Noting that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/3/f23daf5a608fc6ecca4e6ce1a5de3f806bbbb88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\usepackage{gensymb} 25 \\degree + 20 \\degree = 45 \\degree$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" />, we apply the angle sum formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/3/3f3265fd9e81951a8d1093867a7e5852ed120451.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan(A+B) = \\frac{\\tan A+\\tan B}{1-\\tan A\\tan B},\\]\" width=\"244\" height=\"38\" /> giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/3/393b979acc40a666688dff6e802dbbeafc0614c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}1 &amp;= \\tan 45^{\\circ} \\\\ &amp;= \\tan(A+B) \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\tan A+\\tan B}{1-\\tan A\\tan B},\\end{align*}\" width=\"161\" height=\"88\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9dae428245f000e81b58369f51620db86e24478f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan A + \\tan B = 1-\\tan A\\tan B.\\]\" width=\"258\" height=\"14\" /> Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4bc70ffb8d73b1e8890ba2f5e9abf8fa4cd52b1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}(1+\\tan A)(1+\\tan B) &amp;= 1+\\tan A+\\tan B+\\tan A\\tan B \\\\ &amp;= 1+\\left(1-\\tan A\\tan B\\right)+\\tan A\\tan B \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\text{(B)} \\ 2}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"478\" height=\"79\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding in terms of sines and cosines, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db7833c922903a0bc5ac45067e183bb8212ce59.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\left(1+\\tan A\\right)\\left(1+\\tan B\\right) &amp;= \\left(\\frac{\\cos A}{\\cos A}+\\frac{\\sin A}{\\cos A}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\cos B}{\\cos B}+\\frac{\\sin B}{\\cos B}\\right) \\\\ &amp;=\\frac{\\left(\\sin A+\\cos A\\right)\\left(\\sin B+\\cos B\\right)}{\\cos A\\cos B} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sin A\\sin B+\\cos A\\cos B+\\sin A\\cos B+\\sin B\\cos A}{\\cos A\\cos B}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"614\" height=\"132\" />\n</p><p>Recalling the angle sum identities <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d85ac5698b496d9b0f7be705afa9b78510ebf493.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}&amp;\\cos(A-B) = \\sin A\\sin B+\\cos A\\cos B \\text{ and} \\\\ &amp;\\sin(A+B)=\\sin A\\cos B+\\sin B\\cos A,\\end{align*}\" width=\"335\" height=\"43\" /> this reduces to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/8/f68c3224b668e84093f77e1d35a047b03a05e5d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\cos(A-B)+\\sin(A+B)}{\\cos A\\cos B}.\\]\" width=\"203\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Now, using the product-to-sum formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b0b445260f6c255a5e30319746333c1fc1380f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos A\\cos B = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\cos(A-B)+\\cos(A+B)\\right),\\]\" width=\"347\" height=\"37\" /> we can simplify the denominator, yielding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/187328bdde1e5b68ede605fa1cad9ca637885c8b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(1+\\tan A\\right)\\left(1+\\tan B\\right) = \\frac{\\cos(A-B)+\\sin(A+B)}{\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\cos(A-B)+\\cos(A+B)\\right)}.\\]\" width=\"439\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>Finally, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/4/a5421a391ffac8450c0c94f9e3660ae4614506c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\usepackage{gensymb} A+B = 45 \\degree$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb18fb52c55bf8ebf0b3b0c9fe75122ca8e182ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(A+B) = \\cos(A+B)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"20\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c82a175b16d899381c9d9f91674d375a415e3120.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\left(1+\\tan A\\right)\\left(1+\\tan B\\right) &amp;= \\frac{\\cos(A-B)+\\sin(A+B)}{\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\cos(A-B)+\\sin(A+B)\\right)} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\text{(B)} \\ 2}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"432\" height=\"129\" />\n</p><p><i>Remark</i>: Notice that we only used the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb18fb52c55bf8ebf0b3b0c9fe75122ca8e182ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(A+B) = \\cos(A+B)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"20\" />, so we have in fact shown that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/3/b73de393b0fb4aa8858f8544d2b293e3198a0170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1+\\tan A\\right)\\left(1+\\tan B\\right) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" /> not just for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57046f0775e67fa0d7e608fa96996c2edf97563.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\usepackage{gensymb} A = 20 \\degree$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cba6e44c7dc69d5f9448eb7c8a0d315b3d1b673.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\usepackage{gensymb} B = 25 \\degree$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, but also for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f642cbbd390b4882363ab6b5c2906dbf6be6cc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/3/ef38112b8225c5d9708733d7410e85c2b8a6a4d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\usepackage{gensymb} A+B = 45 \\degree + 180 \\degree n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"170\" height=\"16\" /> for integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As in Solution 2, we rewrite the expression as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/c/27c812ee1a82479b65d42c39c4ed728e997ca184.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\cos 20^{\\circ} \\cos 25^{\\circ} + \\cos 20^{\\circ} \\sin 25^{\\circ} + \\sin 20^{\\circ} \\cos 25^{\\circ} + \\sin 20^{\\circ} \\sin 25^{\\circ}}{\\cos 20^{\\circ} \\cos 25^{\\circ}},\\]\" width=\"502\" height=\"38\" /> and hence as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6db719a285077bfdf80cfefab9471229eab4acd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 + \\frac{\\cos 20^{\\circ} \\sin 25^{\\circ} + \\sin 20^{\\circ} \\cos 25^{\\circ} + \\sin 20^{\\circ} \\sin 25^{\\circ}}{\\cos 20^{\\circ} \\cos 25^{\\circ}}.\\]\" width=\"402\" height=\"38\" /> Using the angle sum identities <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d85ac5698b496d9b0f7be705afa9b78510ebf493.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}&amp;\\cos(A-B) = \\sin A\\sin B+\\cos A\\cos B \\text{ and} \\\\ &amp;\\sin(A+B)=\\sin A\\cos B+\\sin B\\cos A,\\end{align*}\" width=\"335\" height=\"43\" /> we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/5/d759d62af1fa83aa27305ff69b03af3cf68616e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}&amp;\\cos 20^{\\circ} \\sin 25^{\\circ} + \\sin 20^{\\circ} \\cos 25^{\\circ} = \\sin\\left(20^{\\circ}+25^{\\circ}\\right) = \\sin 45^{\\circ} \\text{ and} \\\\ &amp;\\cos 20^{\\circ} \\cos 25^{\\circ} - \\sin 20^{\\circ} \\sin 25^{\\circ} = \\cos\\left(20^{\\circ}+25^{\\circ}\\right) = \\cos 45^{\\circ}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"481\" height=\"43\" /> Therefore the expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/e/dbe2ac16bb1bf5ecaabaff9e8c9a99b75388f1fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}1+\\frac{\\sin 45^{\\circ} + \\sin 20^{\\circ} \\sin 25^{\\circ}}{\\cos 45^{\\circ} + \\sin 20^{\\circ} \\sin 25^{\\circ}} &amp;= 1+1 \\qquad \\text{(since } \\sin 45^{\\circ} = \\cos 45^{\\circ}\\text{)} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\text{(B)} \\ 2}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"496\" height=\"74\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As in Solutions 2 and 3, the expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/903dbdf06384b3efaa930a2b73a4d0d060963534.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{\\cos A+\\sin A}{\\cos A}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\cos B+\\sin B}{\\cos B}\\right).\\]\" width=\"273\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Now, using the identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/3/753383af04ac7f80c57f134c3733773633b16163.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^2 A + \\sin^2 A = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"19\" /> and the double-angle identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0a041fd5cfd2070a57cf2b8c04c54ac92cbe077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(2A) = 2\\sin A\\cos A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"20\" />, we observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/5/9e574698d812858515ac12d1e3fa43a5c01b16e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\left(\\cos A + \\sin A\\right)^2 &amp;= \\cos^2 A + \\sin^2 A + 2\\sin A \\cos A \\\\ &amp;= 1 + 2\\sin A \\cos A \\\\ &amp;= 1 + \\sin(2A).\\end{align*}\" width=\"381\" height=\"72\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are acute, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8b5d5b4dab63a95011d17035b962dcb5a981bde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin A,\\cos A,\\sin B,\\cos B &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"222\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7babe99907e5c8f1419505f4e65cdaff62b4b5a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos A + \\sin A &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b86fcc0554f41d1d913b2abd1f634e2117690.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos B + \\sin B &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" />. Hence, taking the positive square root of both sides in the above identity, the expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/9/73979a65a016ba195ce2d8332a162c6e04d31f7d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{1+\\sin(2A)}}{\\cos A}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{1+\\sin(2B)}}{\\cos B}\\right).\\]\" width=\"287\" height=\"53\" /> Recalling the further identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/2/1625f85a25946e93861737c1f809d934a3949683.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin A = \\cos\\left(90^{\\circ}-A\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"168\" height=\"20\" />, together with the half-angle identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/4/c04183a9cc1b5e88988096d88af19f8a6b357523.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos\\left(\\frac{A}{2}\\right) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1+\\cos A}{2}} \\qquad \\text{for } 0^{\\circ} \\leq A \\leq 180^{\\circ},\\]\" width=\"365\" height=\"46\" /> we finally obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/3977e22edee291f021025a6afe593d7623f55229.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\left(1+\\tan A\\right)\\left(1+\\tan B\\right) &amp;= 2\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac{1+\\cos\\left(90^{\\circ}-2A\\right)}{2}}}{\\cos A}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac{1+\\cos\\left(90^{\\circ}-2B\\right)}{2}}}{\\cos B}\\right) \\\\ &amp;= 2\\left(\\frac{\\cos\\left(45^{\\circ}-A\\right)}{\\cos A}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\cos\\left(45^{\\circ}-B\\right)}{\\cos B}\\right) \\\\ &amp;= 2\\left(\\frac{\\cos 25^{\\circ} \\cos 20^{\\circ}}{\\cos 20^{\\circ} \\cos 25^{\\circ}}\\right) = \\boxed{\\text{(B)} \\ 2}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"512\" height=\"165\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems